run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7643391Z ^[[0m
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7644260Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7645217Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7645712Z 
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7646073Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7646997Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7647441Z 
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7647739Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7648541Z    if you are ready to continue.
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7648822Z 
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7649310Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7649909Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7650430Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7650889Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7651210Z 
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7651445Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7651758Z 
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7652026Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7652515Z    can use Nix.
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7652696Z 
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7652879Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
run-tests	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:16:13.7653131Z 
