build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5081314Z ^[[0m
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5095496Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5096224Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5096573Z 
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5097124Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5097678Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5098101Z 
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5098396Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
