build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5099262Z 
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5099974Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
