build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5100855Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5101165Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5101317Z 
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5101472Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
