build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5101878Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5102204Z    can use Nix.
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5102317Z 
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5102406Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
