build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5102819Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
build-and-push-package	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-24T17:23:35.5103281Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
